1
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:05,360
这是一个笼罩了我们几个世纪的噩梦。
Freeman: It is a nightmare that has stalked us for centuries.

2
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:11,020
人类变成了没有思维能力的、
Hordes of human beings transformed

3
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:13,790
嗜血的怪物，
into mindless, bloodthirsty monsters,

4
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:17,360
文明也随之崩溃。
and civilization collapses. [ Siren wailing ]

5
