这个噩梦会变成现实吗？
Could this nightmare become reality?

6
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:31,760
科学家们发现寄生菌能控制生物
Scientists have discovered parasites that turn the living

7
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:35,040
将其变为行尸走肉，
into the walking dead,

8
